@page "/projects/portfolio"

<ProjectLayout Project="@ProjectData.Get("portfolio")">
    <div>
        <h2>What?</h2>
        <p>This is my portfolio website, used for showing the projects I have worked/am working on.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2>Why?</h2>
        <p>This website makes it easy to show to people what I can.</p>
        <p>It also makes it easier to document stuff. Maybe even create a blog later on.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
        <h2>How?</h2>
        <p>This website uses C# with Blazor because I have recently started using Blazor more and more and I'm starting to really like it.</p>
        <p>It is also being hosted on my <a href="/projects/homelab">Homelab</a></p>
    </div>
</ProjectLayout>